<title>USA: U.S. Mint buys 220,000 kg nickel at avg $7.5854/kg.</title>
<headline>U.S. Mint buys 220,000 kg nickel at avg $7.5854/kg.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint said Friday that it bought 220,000 kg of nickel from Considar Inc at an average price of $7.5854 per kg.</p>
<p>The total price of the nickel was $1,668,788.00, the Mint said.</p>
